#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:16
msgid ""
"Mattermost Calls provides metrics through Prometheus for both the Calls "
"plugin and the RTCD service. These metrics help track:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 통화(Calls)는 통화 플러그인과 RTCD 서비스 모두에 대해 Prometheus를 통해 메트릭을 제공합니다. 이러한 메트릭은 다음을 추적하는 데 도움이 됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:18
msgid "Active call sessions and participants"
msgstr "활성 통화 세션 및 참가자"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:19
msgid "Media track statistics"
msgstr "미디어 트랙 통계"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:20
msgid "Connection states and errors"
msgstr "연결 상태 및 오류"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:21
msgid "Resource utilization (CPU, memory, network)"
msgstr "리소스 사용률(CPU, 메모리, 네트워크)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:22
msgid "WebSocket connections and events"
msgstr "WebSocket 연결 및 이벤트"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:24
msgid "The metrics are exposed through HTTP endpoints:"
msgstr "메트릭은 HTTP 엔드포인트를 통해 노출됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:26
msgid "**Calls Plugin**: `/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics`"
msgstr "**통화 플러그인**: `/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics`"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:27
msgid "**RTCD Service**: `/metrics` (default) or a configured endpoint"
msgstr "**RTCD 서비스**: `/metrics`(기본값) 또는 구성된 엔드포인트"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:29
msgid ""
"Resource utilization metrics (CPU, memory, network) are mainly provided "
"by an external service ([`node-"
"exporter`](https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/node-exporter/))."
msgstr "리소스 사용률 메트릭(CPU, 메모리, 네트워크)은 주로 외부 서비스([`node-exporter`](https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/node-exporter/))에서 제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:31
msgid ""
"Metrics for the calls plugin are exposed through the "
"`/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics` subpath under the existing "
"Mattermost server metrics endpoint. This is controlled by the [Listen "
"address for performance](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/environment-configuration-settings.html#listen-address-for-performance) "
"configuration setting. It defaults to port 8067. For example: "
"`http://localhost:8067/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics` The RTCD "
"Service `/metrics` endpoint is exposed on the HTTP API (e.g. "
"`http://localhost:8045/metrics`)."
msgstr "통화 플러그인의 메트릭은 기존 OKR.BEST 서버 메트릭 엔드포인트 아래의 `/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics` 하위 경로를 통해 노출됩니다. 이는 [성능 수신 주소](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure/environment-configuration-settings.html#listen-address-for-performance) 구성 설정으로 제어됩니다. 기본값은 포트 8067입니다. 예: `http://localhost:8067/plugins/com.mattermost.calls/metrics` RTCD 서비스 `/metrics` 엔드포인트는 HTTP API에 노출됩니다(예: `http://localhost:8045/metrics`)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:34
msgid "Setting Up Monitoring"
msgstr "모니터링 설정"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:36
msgid ""
"For instructions on deploying Prometheus and Grafana for Mattermost, "
"please refer to the [Deploy Prometheus and Grafana for Performance "
"Monitoring](https://docs.mattermost.com/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-"
"for-performance-monitoring.html) guide."
msgstr "OKR.BEST용 Prometheus 및 Grafana 배포에 대한 지침은 [성능 모니터링을 위한 Prometheus 및 Grafana 배포](https://docs.mattermost.com/scale/deploy-prometheus-grafana-for-performance-monitoring.html) 가이드를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:38
msgid ""
"Once Prometheus and Grafana are set up, you will need to configure "
"Prometheus to scrape metrics from the Calls-related services."
msgstr "Prometheus 및 Grafana가 설정되면, 통화 관련 서비스에서 메트릭을 스크래핑하도록 Prometheus를 구성해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:40
msgid "Prometheus Scrape Configuration"
msgstr "Prometheus 스크래핑 구성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:42
msgid "Add the following jobs to your `prometheus.yml` configuration:"
msgstr "`prometheus.yml` 구성에 다음 작업을 추가합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:75
msgid "Replace the placeholder IP addresses with your actual server addresses:"
msgstr "자리 표시자 IP 주소를 실제 서버 주소로 바꿉니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:77
msgid "`MATTERMOST_SERVER_IP`: IP address of your Mattermost server"
msgstr "`MATTERMOST_SERVER_IP`: OKR.BEST 서버의 IP 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:78
msgid "`RTCD_SERVER_IP`: IP address of your RTCD server"
msgstr "`RTCD_SERVER_IP`: RTCD 서버의 IP 주소"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:79
msgid ""
"`CALLS_OFFLOADER_SERVER_IP`: IP address of your calls-offloader server "
"(if deployed)"
msgstr "`CALLS_OFFLOADER_SERVER_IP`: calls-offloader 서버의 IP 주소(배포된 경우)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:82
msgid ""
"**Metrics Configuration Notice**: Use the `service_name` labels as shown "
"in the configuration above. These labels help organize metrics in "
"dashboards and enable proper service identification."
msgstr "**메트릭 구성 알림**: 위 구성에 표시된 대로 `service_name` 레이블을 사용하세요. 이러한 레이블은 대시보드에서 메트릭을 정리하고 적절한 서비스 식별을 가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:86
msgid ""
"**node_exporter**: Optional but recommended for system-level metrics "
"(CPU, memory, disk, network). See [node_exporter setup "
"guide](https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/node-exporter/) for installation"
" instructions."
msgstr "**node_exporter**: 선택 사항이지만 시스템 수준 메트릭(CPU, 메모리, 디스크, 네트워크)에 권장됩니다. 설치 지침은 [node_exporter 설정 가이드](https://prometheus.io/docs/guides/node-exporter/)를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:87
msgid ""
"**calls-offloader**: Only needed if you have call recording/transcription"
" enabled."
msgstr "**calls-offloader**: 통화 녹화/전사가 활성화된 경우에만 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:90
msgid "Mattermost Calls Grafana Dashboard"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 통화(Calls) Grafana 대시보드"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:92
msgid ""
"You can use the official [Mattermost Calls Performance "
"Monitoring](https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/23225-mattermost-"
"calls-performance-monitoring/) dashboard to visualize these metrics."
msgstr "공식 [Mattermost Calls Performance Monitoring](https://grafana.com/grafana/dashboards/23225-mattermost-calls-performance-monitoring/) 대시보드를 사용하여 이러한 메트릭을 시각화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:94
msgid "To import it directly into Grafana, use dashboard ID: `23225`."
msgstr "Grafana로 직접 가져오려면, 대시보드 ID `23225`를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-metrics-monitoring.md:95
msgid ""
"The dashboard is also available as JSON source from the [Mattermost "
